ression by quantum measurement reversal. Physical Review A, 81(4):040103, 2010."}],"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/2949885"}},{"reference":{"label":"23","publication_info":{"journal_volume":"8","artid":"117","year":2012,"page_start":"117","journal_title":"Nature Phys."},"misc":["Yong-Su Kim, Jong-Chan Lee, Osung Kwon, and Yoon-Ho Kim. Protecting entanglement from decoherence using weak measurement and quantum measurement reversal"]},"raw_refs":[{"schema":"text","source":"arXiv","value":"[23] Yong-Su Kim, Jong-Chan Lee, Osung Kwon, and Yoon-Ho Kim. Protecting entanglement from decoherence using weak measurement and quantum measurement reversal. Nature Physics, 8(2):117, 2012."}],"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/2732080"}},{"reference":{"label":"24","publication_info":{"journal_volume":"104","artid":"080503","year":2010,"journal_title":"Phys.Rev.Lett."},"misc":["GG Gillett, RB Dalton, BP Lanyon, MP Almeida, Marco Barbieri","JL Obrien, KJ Resch, SD Bartlett, and AG White. Experimental feedback control of quantum systems using weak measurements"],"authors":[{"full_name":"Pryde, Geoff J."}]},"raw_refs":[{"schema":"text","source":"arXiv","value":"[24] GG Gillett, RB Dalton, BP Lanyon, MP Almeida, Marco Barbieri, Geoff J Pryde, JL Obrien, KJ Resch, SD Bartlett, and AG White. Experimental feedback control of quantum systems using weak measurements. Physical review letters, 104(8):080503, 2010."}],"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/2933691"}},{"reference":{"label":"25","publication_info":{"year":2012},"misc":["Chris Macklin, DH Slichter, SJ Weber, KW Murch, Ravi Naik, Alexander N Korotkov","and Irfan Siddiqi. Stabilizing rabi oscillations in a superconducting qubit using quantum feedback. Nature, 490(7418):77"],"authors":[{"full_name":"Vijay, R."}]},"raw_refs":[{"schema":"text","source":"arXiv","value":"[25] R Vijay, Chris Macklin, DH Slichter, SJ Weber, KW Murch, Ravi Naik, Alexander N Korotkov, and Irfan S